Here is the complete guide on how to proceed:

**1. Confirm Eligibility Immediately**
The very first rule to remember is that once a person becomes disabled, they should apply as soon as possible [p21]. Since you don't have their medical diagnosis yet or her specific condition at this exact moment, Social Security needs more information before making the determination of disability. The most urgent next step would be to complete an "Adult Disability Report" and schedule an appointment with your aunt at a local Social Security office or call the toll-free number 1-800-772-1213 [p317].

